#: includes/rules/class-rule-catalog.php:43
msgid "Active subscriptions where the manual-renewal flag is true even though the gateway is Stripe and a customer or source ID is on file. Maps directly to the four subscriptions-core bugs disclosed in April 2026 (stale dates cache, HPOS↔postmeta sync gap, wcs_create_subscription state discard, same-gateway switch)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/rules/class-rule-catalog.php:44
msgid "Clears the manual-renewal flag in both the orders table and postmeta, re-stamps next_payment if past-due, and schedules a fresh renewal so WCS bills automatically again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/rules/class-rule-catalog.php:49
msgid "Active subscription with no scheduled renewal - silent revenue loss."
msgstr ""

#: includes/rules/class-rule-catalog.php:50
